<title>UK: UK's RMC buys Croatia's Dalmacijacement.</title>
<headline>UK's RMC buys Croatia's Dalmacijacement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building materials supplier RMC Group Plc said on Monday its unit RMC International Cement Ltd had bought a 51 percent stake in Croatia's Dalmacijacement d.d. for 34 million stg.</p>
<p>RMC said Dalmacijacement, located at Split, was the largest cement producer in Croatia with annual production of 2.3 million tonnes.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
